OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral scandal mum backs bill to
OL,4,Aregulate sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose baby son's body was in
OL,7,Fthe care of jailed funeral directors
OL,8,Fsays the industry should have been
OL,9,Fregulated years ago.
OL,11,FCorrinne Boulton, from Portsmouth,
OL,12,FHampshire, is backing a bill introduced
OL,13,Fby Gosport MP Dame Caroline Dinenage
OL,14,Fthat would create a government register
OL,15,Fof everyone who handles the bodies of
OL,16,Fthe dead.
OL,18,FIt follows the case of Richard Elkin
OL,19,Fand Hayley Bell, who were jailed in
OL,20,FFebruary after keeping 46 bodies in
OL,21,Funrefrigerated conditions at their
OL,22,Ffuneral home in Gosport.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
