OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral scandal mum backs bill to
OL,4,Aregulate sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was working
OL,7,Frapidly to regulate the sector, but
OL,8,Fthat it needed to be carefully designed
OL,9,Fso it did not harm the vast majority of
OL,10,Ffuneral firms.
